questions.prompt:
Look at this code:
Student s = new Student();
s.age = 20;
s.haveBirthday();
If haveBirthday() does 'age = age + 1;', what is s.age now?

practiceProblems.solutionCode:
class Student {
    String name;
    int age;

    void haveBirthday() {
        age = age + 1;
        System.out.println(name + " is now " + age + " years old!");
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Student s = new Student();
        s.name = "Rahul";
        s.age = 20;
        s.haveBirthday();
    }
}

